# VHS 脚本 · 重新生成 GIF：vhs demo/demo.tape
Output env-doctor.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1180
Set Height 690
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 12
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 400ms
Type "bash demo.sh" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 17s
